Zephyr uses the following open source components. We are grateful to all contributors.

This file is a summary. The complete license texts of every component —
as required for binary distribution — ship with the app in
`apps/desktop/src-tauri/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt` (also readable in the app
under Settings > About > Third-party Licenses) and are generated from the
lockfiles by `scripts/generate-licenses.sh`.

